              "version_added": "1",
              "notes": "The `color` and `background-color` of `<option>` elements are not applied in drop-down `<select>` popups on Linux and macOS, where the popup keeps its native appearance. See [bug 1338283](https://bugzil.la/1338283) and [bug 1703866](https://bugzil.la/1703866)."
